{"page":3,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:6","surah":2,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ سَوَآءٌ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَأَنذَرْتَهُمْ أَمْ لَمْ تُنذِرْهُمْ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who disbelieve, it makes no difference whether you warn them or not: they will not believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve[d]","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سَوَآءٌ","en_gloss":"(it) is same","transliteration":"sawāon","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَأَنذَرْتَهُمْ","en_gloss":"whether you warn them","transliteration":"a-andhartahum","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تُنذِرْهُمْ","en_gloss":"you warn them","transliteration":"tundhir'hum","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"they believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"2:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:6"}]},{"verse_key":"2:7","surah":2,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"خَتَمَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ وَعَلَىٰ سَمْعِهِمْ ۖ وَعَلَىٰٓ أَبْصَـٰرِهِمْ غِشَـٰوَةٌ ۖ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has sealed their hearts and their ears, and their eyes are covered. They will have great torment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"خَتَمَ","en_gloss":"Has set a seal","transliteration":"khatama","verse_key":"2:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿ